Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.49,0:01:41.24,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}回忆中响起了温柔旋律
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.58,0:01:47.67,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}人云世无永恒 万物皆为云烟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.67,0:01:53.00,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}不妨坦然接受 尝试微笑以对
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:57.63,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}烛华不吝照耀 光芒终将殆尽
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.63,0:02:08.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}我们依旧奋勇直前 直到燃尽生命之火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.65,0:02:11.27,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}发得出声音的玩具也好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.27,0:02:14.11,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}能吹飞疼痛的魔法也好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.11,0:02:18.53,OPCN,,0,0,0,fx,{\an5\bord0\fscx100\fscy100\fad(150,400)\move(865,1013,1115,1013)\c&HFFFFFF&}于我而言都是无价之宝
